# Astro-Arc never stores credentials, generated state, or caches inside
# this plugin directory in the first place (the API key lives only in the
# system keyring via secret-tool; config/state/models live under
# ~/.local/state and ~/.local/share, not here) — this file is defense in
# depth against that ever changing by accident, so nothing here can end up
# packaged into a published git repo.
*.key
*api-key*
*apikey*
*secret*
*.env
.env.*
config.json
astro-arc.json
last-run.json
reading-*.json
reviews/
history/
models/
venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
